68,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Rin, trust is not a budget line. The mobile service’s vehicle line overran by a third. Once the grant expires, the flat budget absorbs that recurring cost.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Rin, trust is not a strategy. My data shows the tool certification lapsed. We cannot rely on unverified skills. We need a proposal that fits our actual roster.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Benjamin, I hear your caution. The vehicle line is a heavy burden. Let us consider the Digital Archive Portal, which relies on bench tooling that ships quickly, avoiding the fragile supplier delays.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, the portal is quiet, but it does not reach the outer wards. My data shows remote use peaks after nine, yet we lock up. We must bridge that physical gap.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
