78,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Rin, partner survival is anecdotal. The grant covers sessions for twelve months, then the flat budget absorbs the recurring cost. We must choose a proposal that survives that structural shift.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
